 "descripcion": "Afraid of dying, the Monkey King crossed the sea to find a master, learned 72 transformations, and took an iron pillar from the Dragon King.\n\nFrom Journey to the West, by Wu Cheng'en (16th century), chapters 1-3.\n\nWhich power would you pick?\n\n#mythology #monkeyking #sunwukong #chinesemythology #shorts",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "He cried because, one day, even a king must die.",
