  {
   "texto": "So he crossed the sea, looking for a master.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The master, Subodhi, gave him a name: Sun Wukong.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He learned seventy-two transformations, and the cloud somersault.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
