   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "For a weapon, he visited the Dragon King of the Eastern Sea.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He took an iron pillar that could shrink into a needle.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "Soon, Heaven itself would know his name. Part three, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
